    "promisePassageEn": "«But he gives more grace. Therefore it says, “God resists the proud, but gives grace to the humble.”»",
    "meditationEs": "Santiago dice que Dios da gracia a los humildes. La gracia no se gana presumiendo: se recibe con las manos abiertas.",
    "meditationEn": "James says God gives grace to the humble. Grace is not earned by boasting: it is received with open hands.",
    "declarationEs": "Camino con humildad delante de Dios.",
    "declarationEn": "I walk humbly before God."
