    "promisePassageEn": "«Therefore, my beloved brothers, be steadfast, immovable, always abounding in the Lord’s work, because you know that your labor is not in vain in the Lord.»",
    "meditationEs": "Pablo dice que tu trabajo en el Señor no es en vano. No todo se ve ahora, pero nada se pierde delante de Dios.",
    "meditationEn": "Paul says your labor in the Lord is not in vain. Not everything is seen now, but nothing is lost before God.",
